## When revisiting (restore + wire)

1. If the live header was simplified, restore structure/spacing from this rule (and git history of the symbols above if needed).
2. Replace placeholders with real **bio**, **style tags**, **location**, **social links**; hide empty rows when unset.
3. Wire **Sizes** to the public sizes surface; drop or relocate **Add Friend** / **Redress** on own profile if still placeholders.
4. Keep avatar tap → photo dialog and pencil → Edit Profile unless product changes.
5. Align Edit Profile so users can edit the same fields shown here.
6. Revisit typography with `profile-display-name-font-deferred.mdc`.
7. Delete or mark this rule done once the full header ships with real data.
